{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101561","id":2277937974,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HxpM2","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101561/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101561/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/af900a5825dae39daff8d319b6ecaf12508d5966","number":101561,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change how device address is requested to avoid future API breakage","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100062 introduced BUFFER_USAGE_DEVICE_ADDRESS_BIT.\r\n\r\nHowever it did so by adding a boolean to uniform_buffer_create(), called \"bool p_enable_device_address\".\r\n\r\nThis makes maintaining backwards compatibility harder because I am working on another feature that would require introducing yet another bit flag.\r\n\r\nThis would save us the need to add fallback routines when the feature I am working on makes it to Godot 4.5.\r\n\r\nEven if my feature doesn't make it to 4.5 either, this PR makes the routine more future-proof.\r\n\r\nThis PR also moves STORAGE_BUFFER_USAGE_DEVICE_ADDRESS into BUFFER_CREATION_DEVICE_ADDRESS_BIT, since it's an option available to both storage and uniforms.\r\n\r\nThis PR also moves the boolean use_as_storage into BUFFER_CREATION_AS_STORAGE.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v